# extension/package.json declares no runtime dependencies (the
# @resvg/resvg-js carve-out was removed — hold 3, transitrix-hq#141: PNG
# export rasterizes in the webview's own canvas). Every runtime dependency
# is bundled inline into extension/compiler/ by build-compiler-bundle.mjs, so
# the VSIX ships no extension/node_modules/ at all.
